abstract: >-
  Typed data model and fail-closed validator for the DNA17 voxel: a 17-field record
  with a mandatory dynamic topological structure (neighbors, links and a local
  transition operator), auditable state transitions, and append-only spectral
  memory under memory-preserving transitions. Software claim only; all values are
  dimensionless symbolic quantities.
keywords:
